          "text": "That's a great way to put it. The marriage analogy really captures the difference between wanting to stay together emotionally and actually agreeing on how the country should function. And the fact they managed to separate peacefully and remain close afterward makes the story even more remarkable. 🇨🇿🤝🇸🇰",
